  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>&nbsp;</p><p>Plotting the diagram of given data we have,<img src=\"assets\\st0069_e87edb1c7413.png\" style=\"width: 347px; height: 250px;\" /></p><p>Now to&nbsp;find locus, let centre be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>. According to question</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;distance&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>h</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p>squaring both sides we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></math></p><p>Replacing <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>h</mi></math> with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math> &amp; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi></math> with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi></math> we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8722;</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></math></p>"
